Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:33.80,0:01:35.11,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真走运
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:35.73,0:01:38.37,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}加持先生竟然陪我出来逛街
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:39.72,0:01:42.58,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}{}店内的顾客请注意
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:43.28,0:01:48.30,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}{}从真鹤来的山口先生，您的同伴在等您
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:48.78,0:01:51.65,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}{}请去一楼总台
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:38.76,0:01:42.05,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}什么嘛，这不是泳装专柜嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:42.38,0:01:44.19,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}喂喂，这件怎么样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:44.58,0:01:47.94,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}哎呀哎呀，中学生穿这个还太早了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:48.78,0:01:50.38,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}加持先生太落伍了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:51.13,0:01:53.04,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}现在穿这种程度的泳装是很正常的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:54.31,0:01:56.16,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}哦？是吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:56.64,0:02:00.54,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}难得的修学旅行，要好好开心一下才行啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:00.62,0:02:01.99,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}（旅行指南　市立第一中学）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:00.98,0:02:01.89,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}修学旅行是去哪儿
