Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:07.96,0:02:09.58,special,,0000,0000,0585,,{\fs49.5}{\a3}早餐（自助）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:07.96,0:02:09.58,special,,0000,0000,0383,,{\fs49.5}{\a3}斯库巴潜水（第1次）好啊!!
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:07.96,0:02:09.58,special,,0000,0000,0279,,{\fs49.5}{\a3}午餐（便当）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:07.96,0:02:09.58,special,,0000,0000,0158,,{\fs49.5}{\a3}好!!
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:07.96,0:02:09.58,special,,0000,0131,0000,,{\fs49.5}{\a3}到达旅馆
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:08.15,0:02:09.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}斯库巴潜水啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:10.13,0:02:11.98,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}已经三年没去过了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:12.98,0:02:15.76,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}加持先生修学旅行时去了哪儿
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:16.36,0:02:18.28,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}哦，我们没有这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:19.54,0:02:20.17,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:21.23,0:02:23.11,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为发生了第二次冲击
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:30.07,0:02:33.44,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}哎!? 不能去修学旅行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:34.64,0:02:34.87,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:35.40,0:02:36.13,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:36.51,0:02:37.71,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}要战斗待机
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:37.79,0:02:39.33,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我没听说过这事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:39.57,0:02:40.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}现在告诉你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:40.63,0:02:41.84,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}谁规定的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:42.17,0:02:44.24,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}身为作战负责人的我规定的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:48.85,0:02:50.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你啊！别只顾着喝茶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:50.80,0:02:53.39,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}倒是说点什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:53.49,0:02:54.55,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你是男孩子吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:54.94,0:02:58.33,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}哦，我早就觉得可能会这样了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:58.76,0:03:00.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}就是说你放弃了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:00.74,0:03:01.07,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:01.55,0:03:05.95,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}哼，真没出息，驯顺的男人最差劲了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:06.19,0:03:08.06,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}别这么说嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:09.02,0:03:10.44,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你的心情我了解
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:11.08,0:03:12.56,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过这也是没办法的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:13.08,0:03:15.43,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你们参加修学旅行期间
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:15.60,0:03:17.62,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}使徒可能会来进攻啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:18.52,0:03:21.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}总是待机、待机、待机、待机
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:22.07,0:03:25.27,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}总是等着不知什么时候会打过来的敌人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:25.62,0:03:28.69,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}偶尔也找找敌人的老窝打过去不好么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:29.55,0:03:31.39,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}要是找得到早就这么做了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:32.15,0:03:35.32,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}总之，你们俩都可以把这当作一次好机会
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:35.71,0:03:38.11,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}趁着大家都去参加修学旅行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:38.33,0:03:40.16,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你们可以稍微念点书了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:40.73,0:03:42.87,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}以为我不知道吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:44.24,0:03:46.88,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}想着不拿出来就没人知道可就大错特错了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:47.33,0:03:51.08,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}要打听你们在学校的考试得了几分
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:51.38,0:03:52.45,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那还不是小菜一碟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:52.83,0:03:56.42,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}哈，笑死人了，学校的成绩算什么嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:56.94,0:04:00.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我对老掉牙的扣分式考试可一点兴趣都没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:00.58,0:04:05.17,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}入乡就要随俗，你也好好适应一下日本的学校吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:05.47,0:04:07.76,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不～～～要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:10.82,0:04:13.04,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}明日香，我会给你带礼物的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:14.00,0:04:16.37,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你们俩真是倒霉啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:16.88,0:04:18.98,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我们会连你们的份一起好好玩的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:24.91,0:04:26.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}浅间山的观测数据
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:26.59,0:04:30.42,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}请以最快速度从 Balthasar 复制到 Melchior
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:29.71,0:04:33.37,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}{}EVA 二号机的第 2 次冷却作业准时完成
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:33.60,0:04:34.84,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}{}开始排水作业
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:34.86,0:04:39.64,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}{}EVA 初号机及二号机的 D 型装备换装试验全部与预期相符
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:39.98,0:04:43.19,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}{}明白，EVA 两机开始由机架移动
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:42.56,0:04:45.26,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}{}刚才的观测数据的优先度上升为特 A
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:45.55,0:04:46.92,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}{}以检验作业为最优先
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:38.84,0:04:41.98,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}修学旅行？都这种时候了，还真悠闲啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:42.70,0:04:44.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}正因为是这种时候
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:44.38,0:04:47.05,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以那些孩子们才想趁能玩的时候玩一下啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:55.99,0:04:56.79,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你在干吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:57.92,0:04:59.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}学物理
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:59.35,0:05:01.64,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真是的，到底是乖宝宝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:01.91,0:05:04.35,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不管怎么说，该做的事是一定要做的嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:05.60,0:05:10.12,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}既然不能去冲绳潜水，那就在这里潜吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:10.49,0:05:11.61,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是、是吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:12.23,0:05:13.79,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我说你在做什么呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:14.41,0:05:15.14,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}让我看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:16.85,0:05:18.84,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这种程度的算式就不会做了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:20.22,0:05:20.97,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好了，做完了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:21.93,0:05:22.82,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}很简单嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:23.78,0:05:27.44,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么这么难的你都会做，学校的考试却不行呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:28.67,0:05:31.57,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我不知道题目写的什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:31.91,0:05:35.07,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}就是说你看不懂日语题目
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:35.10,0:05:37.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是啊，汉字我还没认全
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:38.20,0:05:40.19,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}在那边的大学又没学过
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:40.67,0:05:41.19,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}大学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:41.41,0:05:43.09,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}嗯，去年毕业的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:43.93,0:05:46.65,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}喂，这里写的是什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:46.95,0:05:49.26,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是关于热膨胀的问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:49.45,0:05:52.72,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}热膨胀？那么幼稚的问题你也做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:53.31,0:05:57.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}总之，物体遇热会膨胀变大
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:57.00,0:05:59.87,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}遇冷就会收缩变小
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:00.37,0:06:01.51,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}话是这么说…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:02.39,0:06:06.66,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}以我来说，对胸部加热的话不知道会不会变大一点呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:06.89,0:06:09.24,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这、这我怎么知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:09.80,0:06:11.18,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真是不解风情的男人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:32.17,0:06:33.49,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}快看快看，真嗣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:34.93,0:06:36.41,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}背翻式入水（Backroll Entry）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:51.28,0:06:53.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}光凭这个还不好说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:53.33,0:06:56.15,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过正如浅间山地震研究所的报告所说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:56.30,0:06:57.63,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这阴影的确让人在意
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:58.00,0:06:59.43,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}当然不能忽略
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:00.08,0:07:01.07,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}MAGI 怎么判断
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:01.95,0:07:03.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}一半一半
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:03.66,0:07:04.31,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}现场有人去了么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:04.75,0:07:07.24,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}葛城一尉已经到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:12.73,0:07:13.46,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}已经到极限了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:14.03,0:07:15.95,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不，请再往下 500
